{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03791","headline":"春日江津游望 · 杜审言","name":"春日江津游望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旅客摇边思，春江弄晚晴。\n烟销垂柳弱，雾卷落花轻。\n飞棹乘空下，回流向日平。\n鸟啼移几处，蝶舞乱相迎。\n忽叹人皆浊，堤防水至清。\n谷王常不让，深可戒中盈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜审言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}